11
00:02:22,007 --> 00:02:24,007
Ma!

12
00:02:28,007 --> 00:02:30,007
Ma!

13
00:02:30,007 --> 00:02:44,007
Seriously? Even the Prince was no match? That's bad news.

14
00:02:44,007 --> 00:02:46,007
Father...

15
00:02:49,007 --> 00:02:51,007
Okay, get up, Tormentor.

16
00:02:55,007 --> 00:02:59,007
