Ugh!

40
00:03:45,007 --> 00:03:47,007
What are you doing, Gabu?!

41
00:03:48,007 --> 00:03:50,007
What are you doing, Gabu?

42
00:03:50,007 --> 00:03:54,007
Popta, I... I exist to protect.

43
00:03:54,007 --> 00:03:56,007
You don't have to protect her!

44
00:03:56,007 --> 00:03:58,007
