49
00:04:17,007 --> 00:04:23,007
That big robot always looked out for you.

50
00:04:23,007 --> 00:04:25,007
Be quiet.

51
00:04:25,007 --> 00:04:28,007
Was Popta foolish?

52
00:04:28,007 --> 00:04:31,007
Riko, blow that whistle of yours one more time.

53
00:04:31,007 --> 00:04:33,007
This is really bad.

54
00:04:33,007 --> 00:04:36,007
No use, she's not responding.

55
00:04:36,007 --> 00:04:39,007
