Riko!

72
00:05:20,007 --> 00:05:21,007
Riko!

73
00:05:21,007 --> 00:05:22,007
Riko!

74
00:05:22,007 --> 00:05:23,007
There's nothing any of you can do to stop me!

75
00:05:23,007 --> 00:05:24,007
Riko!

76
00:05:24,007 --> 00:05:25,007
Riko!

77
00:05:25,007 --> 00:05:26,007
Riko!

78
00:05:26,007 --> 00:05:27,007
Riko!

79
00:05:27,007 --> 00:05:28,007
Riko!

80
00:05:28,007 --> 00:05:29,007
Riko!

81
00:05:29,007 --> 00:05:30,007
Riko!

82
00:05:30,007 --> 00:05:31,007
Riko!

83
00:05:31,007 --> 00:05:32,007
Riko!

84
00:05:32,007 --> 00:05:33,007
Whoa!

85
00:05:33,007 --> 00:05:34,007
