88
00:05:36,007 --> 00:05:46,007
Aren't you taking this tomboy thing too far?

89
00:05:46,007 --> 00:05:50,007
What does a hollow child want with the likes of Popta?

90
00:05:50,007 --> 00:05:53,007
Well, I wonder that myself.

91
00:05:53,007 --> 00:05:57,007
But you know, I can't just sleep through all this now, can I?

92
00:05:57,007 --> 00:05:58,007
Anachi!

93
00:05:58,007 --> 00:06:00,007
Sorry, Riko.

94
00:06:00,007 --> 00:06:04,007
This isn't the kind of situation where I can say I'll sort it out and be done with it.

95
00:06:04,007 --> 00:06:07,007
You can leave this fight to us.

96
00:06:07,007 --> 00:06:10,007
Sorry, but we have little time.

97
00:06:10,007 --> 00:06:12,007
Yeah, I know.

98
00:06:16,007 --> 00:06:17,007
Let's go, Belov.

99
00:06:17,007 --> 00:06:21,007
