106
00:06:49,007 --> 00:06:53,007
It is something that I've treasured for a long time.

107
00:06:53,007 --> 00:06:58,007
Because it is precious, I wanted to consign it to oblivion along with myself.

108
00:06:58,007 --> 00:07:03,007
I wished for your mother to take everything away from me.

109
00:07:03,007 --> 00:07:06,007
But this is the only thing she allowed me to keep.

110
00:07:06,007 --> 00:07:08,007
I understand now.

111
00:07:08,007 --> 00:07:11,007
She left it untouched because she wanted you to see it.

112
00:07:12,007 --> 00:07:15,007
There's only one way you grew so big!

113
00:07:15,007 --> 00:07:19,007
How much of my mother did you consume?!

114
00:07:19,007 --> 00:07:24,007
Please, Popta.

115
00:07:24,007 --> 00:07:27,007
Accept this gift.

116
00:07:49,007 --> 00:08:03,007
What the hell is this?

117
00:08:08,007 --> 00:08:10,007
What in the world?

118
00:08:10,007 --> 00:08:12,007
As I meet my end...

119
00:08:13,007 --> 00:08:15,007
I'm glad you are here with me.

120
00:08:15,007 --> 00:08:19,007
At the end of your destiny...

121
00:08:19,007 --> 00:08:22,007
There will come a time when you yourself decide your value.

122
00:08:22,007 --> 00:08:24,007
Shut up!

123
00:08:24,007 --> 00:08:25,007
You...

124
00:08:26,007 --> 00:08:27,007
What is...

125
00:08:27,007 --> 00:08:29,007
What is with you?!

126
00:08:29,007 --> 00:08:30,007
What beautiful...

127
00:08:31,007 --> 00:08:32,007
Eyes...

128
00:08:35,007 --> 00:08:37,007
Forge ahead without fear.

129
00:08:38,007 --> 00:08:40,007
I would like for you to enjoy your adventure.

130
00:08:45,007 --> 00:08:46,007
Beloved, no!

131
00:08:46,007 --> 00:08:47,007
Beloved, no!

132
00:08:56,007 --> 00:08:57,007
Nanzufaptabigo.

133
00:08:58,007 --> 00:08:59,007
Hey!

134
00:08:59,007 --> 00:09:00,007
Guys!

135
00:09:00,007 --> 00:09:02,007
Don't touch the perimeter!

136
00:09:02,007 --> 00:09:04,007
The village's membrane has been torn!

137
00:09:04,007 --> 00:09:07,007
If you contact the outside, you will disappear!

138
00:09:08,007 --> 00:09:09,007
Take cover down below!

139
00:09:09,007 --> 00:09:12,007
Bring Riko along with you and let her rest!

140
00:09:12,007 --> 00:09:15,007
The lower level of the village will hold up the best!

141
00:09:15,007 --> 00:09:16,007
And what about you?

142
00:09:16,007 --> 00:09:18,007
I'll wake up Wreck!

143
00:09:21,007 --> 00:09:23,007
It's hard, doesn't it?

144
00:09:23,007 --> 00:09:24,007
I know that.

145
00:09:24,007 --> 00:09:28,007
Carried by sense, the memories wash over you like they're your own.

146
00:09:29,007 --> 00:09:30,007
The emotions...

147
00:09:31,007 --> 00:09:32,007
The longing...

148
00:09:32,007 --> 00:09:35,007
You can feel it wash over you from deep inside.

149
00:09:35,007 --> 00:09:36,007
Well...

150
00:09:36,007 --> 00:09:39,007
That probably won't be nearly enough to stop you though, will it?

151
00:09:40,007 --> 00:09:41,007
I'd better be going.

152
00:09:44,007 --> 00:09:48,007
Beloff told me not to underestimate the one touched by the Divine.

153
00:09:49,007 --> 00:09:51,007
This situation has been chosen by him.

154
00:09:52,007 --> 00:09:54,007
Cradles of Desire, the wish-granting acts.

155
00:09:55,007 --> 00:09:57,007
Among humans, only children are able to use them.

156
00:09:57,007 --> 00:10:04,007
The Princess carries three cradles of desire within her and is the embodiment of wish-granting power.

157
00:10:04,007 --> 00:10:06,007
The conditions are already in place.

158
00:10:07,007 --> 00:10:09,007
Imagine the worst-case scenario.

159
00:10:10,007 --> 00:10:13,007
Riko gets injured in the commotion, and she's on the verge of death.

160
00:10:14,007 --> 00:10:18,007
Then, the Princess, for some reason, perhaps to win back Reg's heart,

161
00:10:19,007 --> 00:10:21,007
gives Riko a piece of herself.

162
00:10:21,007 --> 00:10:25,007
What will the wish-granting power make come true?

163
00:10:27,007 --> 00:10:28,007
Riko...

164
00:10:29,007 --> 00:10:30,007
You're the only one.

165
00:10:31,007 --> 00:10:35,007
The only one who pleads to go adventuring again while on the brink of death.

166
00:10:40,007 --> 00:10:42,007
And make them all into something beyond human.

167
00:10:43,007 --> 00:10:45,007
A force that will challenge the Golden City.

168
00:10:46,007 --> 00:10:47,007
A Riko spawned village.

169
00:10:48,007 --> 00:10:49,007
A kind of blessing device.

170
00:10:49,007 --> 00:10:52,007
Am I overthinking this?

171
00:10:53,007 --> 00:10:54,007
No.

172
00:10:54,007 --> 00:10:56,007
He's the divinely possessed one Belov trusted.

173
00:10:57,007 --> 00:11:00,007
Plus, he's one of those guys who does whatever it takes.

174
00:11:01,007 --> 00:11:02,007
It can't happen.

175
00:11:03,007 --> 00:11:07,007
I won't let that man take that path ever again.

176
00:11:08,007 --> 00:11:09,007
Belov...

177
00:11:10,007 --> 00:11:12,007
It can't be.

178
00:11:13,007 --> 00:11:14,007
What a relief.

179
00:11:14,007 --> 00:11:15,007
That was great.

180
00:11:16,007 --> 00:11:17,007
Are you kidding me?

181
00:11:17,007 --> 00:11:18,007
What is so great?

182
00:11:19,007 --> 00:11:22,007
That smell is Belov's very sentiments, you know.

183
00:11:22,007 --> 00:11:24,007
Now Fopta knows all about you.

184
00:11:25,007 --> 00:11:27,007
So, you probably won't be killed.

185
00:11:28,007 --> 00:11:30,007
However, I'm in real hot water.

186
00:11:31,007 --> 00:11:32,007
Oh, and sorry, Vueko.

187
00:11:33,007 --> 00:11:34,007
Which part are you sorry about?

188
00:11:35,007 --> 00:11:38,007
I pretty much used up all of myself and don't have much left.

189
00:11:39,007 --> 00:11:41,007
So, I can't carry you very comfortably anymore.

190
00:11:41,007 --> 00:11:42,007
What is happening?

191
00:11:42,007 --> 00:11:56,007
You're practically mother and child, aren't you?

192
00:11:57,007 --> 00:11:58,007
Not just practically.

193
00:11:58,007 --> 00:12:00,007
What is...

194
00:12:00,007 --> 00:12:01,007
What is...

195
00:12:01,007 --> 00:12:02,007
The meaning of this?

196
00:12:03,007 --> 00:12:04,007
Hey, Belov.

197
00:12:05,007 --> 00:12:08,007
Ida Miui also feels the same about you.

198
00:12:09,007 --> 00:12:10,007
Must not...

199
00:12:10,007 --> 00:12:12,007
Stop now, Fopta.

200
00:12:12,007 --> 00:12:13,007
Fopta.

201
00:12:14,007 --> 00:12:15,007
Fopta is fire.

202
00:12:16,007 --> 00:12:20,007
The fire that is the successor to the consumed and desecrated.

203
00:12:21,007 --> 00:12:26,007
Until all your rotten bodies are burned to ashes, there is no way Fopta can simply stop.

204
00:12:26,007 --> 00:12:42,007
You're all in danger, so get away from this place.

205
00:12:57,007 --> 00:13:00,007
Is that... a bird?

206
00:13:01,007 --> 00:13:03,007
Do they have villagers like that, too?

207
00:13:06,007 --> 00:13:07,007
No, wait!

208
00:13:08,007 --> 00:13:09,007
The village's defenses are gone!

209
00:13:09,007 --> 00:13:10,007
They've made their way inside!

210
00:13:13,007 --> 00:13:14,007
Jizo!

211
00:13:19,007 --> 00:13:20,007
A turbinate?

212
00:13:21,007 --> 00:13:22,007
That's not good.

213
00:13:22,007 --> 00:13:26,007
It's the primeval creatures that rule this world of the absolute boundary.

214
00:13:39,007 --> 00:13:40,007
Not good.

215
00:13:41,007 --> 00:13:42,007
Not good at all.

216
00:13:42,007 --> 00:13:51,007
The creatures are really starting to swarm in.

217
00:13:52,007 --> 00:13:55,007
Without defenses, I guess it makes for a great feeding ground.

218
00:13:56,007 --> 00:13:57,007
We can't handle this.

219
00:13:57,007 --> 00:13:59,007
There's too many of them.

220
00:14:00,007 --> 00:14:01,007
It's all over.

221
00:14:02,007 --> 00:14:03,007
This'll be the end of us.

222
00:14:05,007 --> 00:14:06,007
Don't worry.

223
00:14:07,007 --> 00:14:09,007
Oh, yes, that's right, Ma.

224
00:14:09,007 --> 00:14:11,007
We've at least got to evacuate the kids.

225
00:14:11,007 --> 00:14:12,007
What are you doing?

226
00:14:16,007 --> 00:14:17,007
Those are Fopta's prey!

227
00:14:17,007 --> 00:14:19,007
You let go of them!

228
00:14:22,007 --> 00:14:24,007
Do not take away Fopta's duty!

229
00:14:25,007 --> 00:14:27,007
And the reason I am alive!

230
00:14:41,007 --> 00:14:44,007
It was Mother's last wish!

231
00:14:47,007 --> 00:14:48,007
It was Mother's last wish!

232
00:14:49,007 --> 00:14:51,007
Fopta was to destroy them!

233
00:14:51,007 --> 00:14:52,007
Nya!

234
00:14:53,007 --> 00:14:54,007
Huah!

235
00:14:55,007 --> 00:14:56,007
Uhуйте!

236
00:14:57,007 --> 00:14:58,007
idades!

237
00:14:58,007 --> 00:15:00,007
Fopta!

238
00:15:16,007 --> 00:15:17,007
Tchamatan!

239
00:15:17,007 --> 00:15:32,827
No, there is nothing left for Fopta anymore

240
00:15:32,827 --> 00:15:36,127
Nothing at all

241
00:15:36,127 --> 00:15:42,467
Do not take away Fopta's reason to exist

242
00:15:47,007 --> 00:16:00,407
Tell me, why is it that I, even though the princess tried to eradicate us, I find myself feeling like this

243
00:16:00,407 --> 00:16:05,147
So please, I'm begging you, just flee already

244
00:16:05,147 --> 00:16:07,727
There's just too many of them to handle

245
00:16:07,727 --> 00:16:12,247
Then why, Fopta immortal?

246
00:16:12,247 --> 00:16:18,427
Is it just, is it so Fopta will suffer like this?

247
00:16:18,427 --> 00:16:38,207
Hio, Kati, Togi, I'm sorry, you all came to save me

248
00:16:38,207 --> 00:16:51,827
You dare, you dare do this

249
00:16:51,827 --> 00:16:58,267
Can, can hardly move

250
00:16:58,267 --> 00:17:17,727
Gavu, Gavu, Gavu

251
00:17:17,727 --> 00:17:21,127
Fopta, my apologies

252
00:17:21,127 --> 00:17:24,307
I could not protect you

253
00:17:24,307 --> 00:17:27,767
Gavu, what are you talking about?

254
00:17:28,587 --> 00:17:31,367
Gavu, please, please get up

255
00:17:31,367 --> 00:17:34,127
If Fopta loses you again, Fopta will-

256
00:17:34,127 --> 00:17:35,127
Gavu

257
00:17:35,127 --> 00:17:43,967
You were born harboring a thirst for revenge

258
00:17:43,967 --> 00:17:46,647
And yet acquired something irreplaceable

259
00:17:46,647 --> 00:17:47,887
And called it Haku

260
00:17:47,887 --> 00:17:49,647
I deeply regret

261
00:17:49,647 --> 00:17:53,227
I cannot be by your side to see the reason behind it

262
00:17:53,227 --> 00:17:54,127
Stop it!

263
00:17:55,247 --> 00:17:55,647
Fop

264
00:17:55,647 --> 00:17:56,327
Stop!

265
00:17:57,407 --> 00:17:59,347
Those days I spent with you

266
00:17:59,347 --> 00:18:01,067
Please stop!

267
00:18:01,247 --> 00:18:03,967
My Haku

268
00:18:03,967 --> 00:18:15,847
I cannot be by your side

269
00:18:15,847 --> 00:18:20,427
Thank you

270
00:18:21,167 --> 00:18:24,827
Rplain

271
00:18:24,827 --> 00:18:25,307
Timo

272
00:18:25,307 --> 00:18:48,107
I can't...

273
00:18:48,107 --> 00:18:49,747
I can't move.

274
00:18:49,747 --> 00:19:04,967
If nothing has been, has been accomplished, there is no value, no value at all, in being immortal.

275
00:19:14,827 --> 00:19:15,967
What is it?

276
00:19:19,747 --> 00:19:34,747
What is this?

277
00:19:34,747 --> 00:19:38,747
Vabta, rise.

278
00:19:38,747 --> 00:19:40,747
Embodiment of value.

279
00:19:40,747 --> 00:19:43,747
Please.

280
00:19:43,747 --> 00:19:45,747
Even if it is you alone...

281
00:19:45,747 --> 00:19:47,747
Survive and live on.

282
00:19:47,747 --> 00:19:48,747
Youngest.

283
00:19:48,747 --> 00:19:49,747
Daughter.

284
00:19:49,747 --> 00:19:52,747
Everything you can use.

285
00:19:52,747 --> 00:19:53,747
Immortal.

286
00:19:57,747 --> 00:19:58,747
Prayers.

287
00:19:58,747 --> 00:20:01,747
All you damn Hollows do is crave.

288
00:20:01,747 --> 00:20:03,747
What are you doing?

289
00:20:03,747 --> 00:20:05,747
What do you want?

290
00:20:05,747 --> 00:20:06,747
Please...

291
00:20:06,747 --> 00:20:10,747
If we could become even just a little of your value...

292
00:20:10,747 --> 00:20:16,747
Fabta always knew it is her duty to destroy every one of you.

293
00:20:16,747 --> 00:20:19,747
Fabta knew it ever since being born.

294
00:20:19,747 --> 00:20:23,747
But Fabta is learning things Fabta never knew.

295
00:20:23,747 --> 00:20:25,747
Including the things Fabta called Haku.

296
00:20:25,747 --> 00:20:28,747
There's a gabaroon that Fabta doesn't know.

297
00:20:28,747 --> 00:20:31,747
A rag that Fabta doesn't know.

298
00:20:31,747 --> 00:20:34,747
There was a mother that Fabta doesn't know.

299
00:20:34,747 --> 00:20:37,747
Fabta doesn't know so many things.

300
00:20:37,747 --> 00:20:40,747
Still, even now my duty drives me.

301
00:20:40,747 --> 00:20:44,747
It compels me to destroy and free mother.

302
00:20:46,747 --> 00:20:47,747
But...

303
00:20:47,747 --> 00:20:49,747
This heat...

304
00:20:49,747 --> 00:20:51,747
The color of this fire...

305
00:20:51,747 --> 00:20:53,747
What is it?

306
00:20:53,747 --> 00:20:54,747
Beyond this duty?

307
00:20:54,747 --> 00:20:57,747
What lies hidden in wait?

308
00:20:57,747 --> 00:20:59,747
Can there really be...

309
00:20:59,747 --> 00:21:01,747
Value?

310
00:21:05,747 --> 00:21:06,747
Huh?

311
00:21:10,747 --> 00:21:12,747
Get her, bossa!

312
00:21:34,747 --> 00:21:36,747
At the end of your destiny...

313
00:21:36,747 --> 00:21:40,747
There will come a time when you yourself decide your value.

314
00:21:41,747 --> 00:21:43,747
Forge ahead without fear.

315
00:21:43,747 --> 00:21:46,747
I would like for you to enjoy your adventure.

316
00:21:48,747 --> 00:21:50,747
You do not decide for me.

317
00:21:50,747 --> 00:21:54,747
Fabta will learn of value for herself, Sosu.

318
00:23:29,992 --> 00:23:59,972
Thank you.

